                    <characteristic name="Description" characteristicTypeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" value="Your Warlord can re-roll all failed To Hit rolls with any Master-crafted weapons he is equipped with, instead of only re-rolling one failed to Hit roll per turn.  This includes any Chapter Relics and Relics of Nocturne that have the Master-crafted special rule."/>
                  </characteristics>
