      <rules>
        <rule id="16c7-58d7-5251-8186" name="Master of the Hunt" book="Codex: Space Marines" hidden="false">
          <profiles/>
          <rules/>
          <infoLinks/>
          <modifiers/>
          <description>If Kor&apos;sarro Khan is your Warlord, friendly White Scars models that have the Bike unit type, or are embarked on a Rhino or Razorback, have the Scout special rule.  In addition, if Kor&apos;sarro Khan slays the enemy Warlord in a challenge, you immediately score D3 extra Victory Points</description>
