                    <characteristic name="Description" characteristicTypeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" value="An Aquila aegis field confers a 6+ invulnerable save.  In addition, a model with an Aquila aegis field ignores Crew Shaken and Crew Stunned results on the Vehicle Damage table (but still loses a Hull Point)"/>
