          <rules>
            <rule id="eee7-2f30-167b-2f57" name="Smash" book="IA: Volume 9" hidden="false">
              <profiles/>
              <rules/>
              <infoLinks/>
              <modifiers/>
              <description>Carab Culln may choose to make a special Smash attack. In doing this halve his Attacks, but double his Strength for that round of combat. In addition, when making a Smash attack, Carab Culln may also re-roll any Armour Penetration tests he is called upon to make. When making a Smash attack, the Blade of the Scorpion is AP2, otherwise it is AP3.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
