              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule id="bc9c-1e86-93d5-6dda" name="Smash" book="IA: Volume 9" hidden="false">
              <profiles/>
              <rules/>
              <infoLinks/>
              <modifiers/>
              <description>Knight-Captain Courbray may choose to make a special Smash attack. In doing this halve his Attacks, but double his Strength for that round of combat. In addition, when making a Smash attack, Knight-Captain Courbray may also re-roll any Armour Penetration tests he is called upon to make.</description>
            </rule>
