              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" characteristicTypeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" value="While a Proteus with this upgrade is on the table, at the start of any of the controlling player&apos;s turns, before any Reserve rolls ar emoade, they may declare that the PRoteus&apos; auguries are being used in Disruption or Relay modes, their effect lasting until their next player turn.  If a Land Raider Proteus is fitted with an Explorator Augury Web, its transport capacity is reduced to eight models.  Distruption Mode: The opposing force sufers -1 to their Reserve Rolls in the next player turn.  Relay Mode: The controlling player&apos;s Reserve rolls may be re-rolled (Whether failed or successful) if they wish."/>
