          <profiles/>
          <rules/>
          <infoLinks/>
          <modifiers/>
          <description>The presence of one or more vehicles on the battlefield adds +1 to the result of the controlling player&apos;s Reserve rolls (note that this effect is not cumulative with other bonuses).</description>
