          <profiles/>
          <rules/>
          <infoLinks/>
          <modifiers/>
          <description>Each time a non-vehicle model suffers a wound from this weapon, roll a D6. On a 4+, the model suffers an additional D3 wounds which must be saved separately using the weapon&apos;s profile (note that these wounds do not themselves generate more additional wounds)</description>
